WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.537 --> 00:00:05.740
The basemap menu gathers the basemap, the overlays and the opacity.

2
00:00:06.843 --> 00:00:13.008
At start-up the map is shown alone and opaque. Tick Aerial photo to slide it underneath.

3
00:00:13.148 --> 00:00:18.268
The slider then sets the map over the photo: here eighty percent, then thirty.

4
00:00:24.314 --> 00:00:28.795
The vertical bar tilts the view: the terrain appears, with its hillshading.
